  "question": {
    "text": "The correct order of increasing basicity of the given conjugate bases $\\left(\\mathrm{R}=\\mathrm{CH}_3\\right)$ is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "\n$\\mathrm{RCO} \\overline{\\mathrm{O}} < \\mathrm{HC}=\\overline{\\mathrm{C}} < \\overline{\\mathrm{R}} < \\overline{\\mathrm{N}} \\mathrm{H}_2$",
