  "solution": {
    "text": "Correct order of increasing basic strength is\n$$\n\\mathrm{R}-\\mathrm{COO}^{(-)} < \\mathrm{CH} \\equiv \\mathrm{C}^{(-)} < \\mathrm{NH}_2^{(-)} < \\mathrm{R}^{(-)}\n$$"
